--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
New (apps/apple/Sources/Features/Dashboard/):
  DashboardModels.swift              value types + pure derivations — DashboardVehicle,
                                     DashboardAuthStatus, DashboardOnboardingMode (web
                                     authenticated?sync:connect), DashboardFeature (the
