a11y / HIG (ADR-006/013/015): TSPageTitle/section headings carry .isHeader; the auth
banner + onboarding + tiles use .accessibilityElement(children:.combine); decorative
glyphs are .accessibilityHidden; the refresh / kiosk-exit controls have explicit
accessibilityLabels; ContentUnavailableView-backed empties; LocalizedStringKey throughout
for Dynamic Type + light/dark; the live-stale banner (TSLiveStaleDataBanner, model
.liveDataStale) is the >2 min staleness indicator. Adaptive: DashboardPage `isCompact`
(#if os(iOS) horizontalSizeClass) stacks the header + scrolls the toolbar on compact
iPhone vs. a single row on macOS / iPad regular; grids reflow by width.

